        <Box style={{
            height: 214, marginTop: 14, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20,
            background: 'rgba(31,122,92,0.08)', borderRadius: 14, padding: 24,
        }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, gap: 12 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 38, height: 38, borderRadius: 19, background: '#1F7A5C', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>1</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1E3A32' }}>
                        <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>浏览</span>：发现页和首页轮播各扫一遍，只看标题，不急着点开
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 38, height: 38, borderRadius: 19, background: '#1F7A5C', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>2</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1E3A32' }}>
                        <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>阅读</span>：点开感兴趣的，重点抓结论句和小标题，细节可以跳
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 38, height: 38, borderRadius: 19, background: '#E08A3C', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>3</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1E3A32' }}>
                        <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>回来提问</span>：看不懂的那句话直接复制进输入框，加一句"这段我不太明白"
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{
                width: 340, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: 18, justifyContent: 'center',
            }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F7A5C', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    先看内容再提问，问题会更具体
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#6B7C75', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10 }}>
                    读过一遍之后，你的问句里会自然带上文章里的词，AI 拿到的背景越多，答案就越贴你的情况。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

